      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "カティナ殿下です！　あの方は本当にラシオネル王子のことが\n大好きだというのに、私まで王子を狙っていると\nいうような発言をしたじゃありませんか！",
      "jp_sha256": "eab7b6c0d863f8ffe03c0d3f725353a1d6b28a753fcb540d3647a12dcea4a560",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "카티나 전하입니다!　그분은 정말로 라시오넬 왕자님을\n좋아하시는데, 저까지 왕자를 노리고 있다는 듯한\n발언을 하지 않았습니까!",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 33,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b004-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "4279bdabcd551e6a13b09ab05b2375032ea188d70e5da1f6ecf67c19f46150c4:000002_4615897417265987892:g0:r32",
